{"outcome":"component","existing":"","reason":"","code":"TextPhotoCarousel","label":"Text and photo carousel","description":"Two columns: a heading, a text and an optional button on one side, and on the other a row of photos the visitor scrolls sideways by hand, snapping on each photo. It has no script and never turns on its own. Use it to present a place, a workshop or a product with several pictures beside its text.","props":"[{"name": "title", "type": "text", "label": "Heading", "max": 120}, {"name": "text", "type": "html", "label": "Text"}, {"name": "button_label", "type": "text", "label": "Button text", "help": "Says where the link leads, such as 'See our creations'.", "max": 80}, {"name": "button_url", "type": "url", "label": "Button link"}, {"name": "carousel_side", "type": "choice", "label": "Side of the photos", "choices": {"right": "Photos on the right", "left": "Photos on the left"}, "default": "right"}, {"name": "gallery_label", "type": "text", "label": "Name of the gallery", "help": "Read by screen readers, such as 'Photos of the workshop'.", "max": 120}, {"name": "photos", "type": "items", "label": "Photos", "min": 1, "max": 12, "items": [{"name": "image", "type": "image", "label": "Photo", "required": true}, {"name": "alt", "type": "text", "label": "What the photo shows", "max": 200}, {"name": "caption", "type": "text", "label": "Caption", "max": 200}]}]","sample":"{"title": "Notre atelier à Clermont-Ferrand", "text": "<p>Depuis 2009, nous fabriquons chaque pièce à la main, dans notre atelier du centre-ville.</p><p>Le bois vient de forêts gérées durablement, à moins de 100 kilomètres.</p>", "button_label": "Découvrir nos créations", "button_url": "/creations", "carousel_side": "right", "gallery_label": "Photos de l’atelier", "photos": [{"image": null, "alt": "Un artisan ponce un plateau de table en chêne.", "caption": "Le ponçage, à la main."}, {"image": null, "alt": "Des planches de noyer sèchent sur des étagères.", "caption": "Le séchage du bois dure six mois."}, {"image": null, "alt": "Une chaise finie posée devant la vitrine de l’atelier.", "caption": "Une chaise prête à partir."}]}","template":"<section class="tpc tpc--{{ props.carousel_side|default('right') }}"><div class="tpc__body">{% if props.title is not empty %}<h2 class="tpc__title">{{ props.title }}</h2>{% endif %}{% if props.text is not empty %}<div class="tpc__text">{{ props.text }}</div>{% endif %}{% if props.button_label is not empty and props.button_url is not empty %}<a class="tpc__button" href="{{ props.button_url }}">{{ props.button_label }}</a>{% endif %}</div>{% if props.photos is not empty %}<ul class="tpc__gallery" tabindex="0"{% if props.gallery_label is not empty %} aria-label="{{ props.gallery_label }}"{% endif %} data-cms-sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 50vw, 100vw">{% for photo in props.photos %}{% if photo.image %}<li class="tpc__slide"><figure class="tpc__figure"><img class="tpc__image" src="{{ photo.image }}" alt="{{ photo.alt|default('') }}" loading="lazy">{% if photo.caption is not empty %}<figcaption class="tpc__caption">{{ photo.caption }}</figcaption>{% endif %}</figure></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul>{% endif %}</section>","css":".tpc { display: grid; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; }
.tpc__title { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--cms-color-text); }
.tpc__text { color: var(--cms-color-text-muted); }
.tpc__button { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.375rem; background: var(--cms-color-accent); color: var(--cms-color-on-accent); text-decoration: none; transition: background-color 0.2s ease; }
.tpc__button:hover { background: var(--cms-color-accent-strong); }
.tpc__button:focus-visible { background: var(--cms-color-accent-strong); outline: 2px solid var(--cms-color-accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
.tpc__gallery { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin: 0; padding: 0 0 0.75rem; list-style: none; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; overscroll-behavior-x: contain; }
.tpc__gallery:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--cms-color-accent); outline-offset: 4px; }
.tpc__slide { flex: 0 0 100%; scroll-snap-align: start; }
.tpc__figure { margin: 0; }
.tpc__image { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0.5rem; background: var(--cms-color-accent-surface); }
.tpc__caption { margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--cms-color-text-subtle); }
@media (min-width: 48rem) { .tpc { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; } .tpc--left .tpc__gallery { order: -1; } }"}

